    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the end of the world, you died.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Stella didn't want to see such an ending, so you resurrected in another timeline of the world and started your battle again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinctive Card-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Ritual Cards to Gain Energy</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As turns progress in combat, the more Ritual cards you play, the more energy you\u2019ll gain in a single turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then unleash that energy to rain down your cards in a powerful burst!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/0463813556978a0c388acdea162a8e0c.poster.avif?t=1753728516\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/0463813556978a0c388acdea162a8e0c.webm?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/0463813556978a0c388acdea162a8e0c.mp4?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Force Play at the Cost of Sin</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to <strong>force-play cards when lacking energy</strong>, or even play multiple Ritual cards in a single turn \u2014 but doing so will <strong>increase your Sin</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your Sin passes the halfway mark, you\u2019ll enter a <strong>Torment state</strong>, drawing harmful negative cards during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if your Sin reaches its peak\u2026 you risk <strong>instant death</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/2e01bcdbfb7d1e1c839aa26d6e974ad9.poster.avif?t=1753728516\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/2e01bcdbfb7d1e1c839aa26d6e974ad9.webm?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/2e01bcdbfb7d1e1c839aa26d6e974ad9.mp4?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Draws from Different Decks</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw piles are split into Ritual, Attack, Skill, and Ability decks. When drawing cards, you can <strong>select which pile to draw from, one card at a time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve ever drawn a full hand of defense while the enemy was powering up their attack, you\u2019ll know exactly why this matters : )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there\u2019s more to this mechanic than meets the eye\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/3e42a71ebacb8f707cfb92bb68c5cb6f.poster.avif?t=1753728516\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/3e42a71ebacb8f707cfb92bb68c5cb6f.webm?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/3e42a71ebacb8f707cfb92bb68c5cb6f.mp4?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wounded HP and Near-Death Survival</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage you take becomes <strong>Wounded HP</strong>, which can be healed using certain cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if left untreated, Damaged HP will decay at the end of the turn and become <strong>permanent loss</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you take a fatal hit, you will <strong>die at the end of your own turn</strong> \u2014 unless... you <strong>restore your HP above zero</strong> or <strong>slay all enemies</strong> before then!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/5c38f2337c8742ee7006f6f71efe7150.poster.avif?t=1753728516\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/5c38f2337c8742ee7006f6f71efe7150.webm?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/5c38f2337c8742ee7006f6f71efe7150.mp4?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow stronger before the sun sets each day</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events emerge across the area as time passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, gather supplies, enhance your deck\u2014every choice matters, and time is limited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At sundown, face the boss in a fight to the death</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/1801154fb8d40ad038474c09fbae49ef.poster.avif?t=1753728516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/1801154fb8d40ad038474c09fbae49ef.webm?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/1801154fb8d40ad038474c09fbae49ef.mp4?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A variety of random events await</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade in black market, enhance cards through meditation, uncover powerful parasites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected surprises</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/6e6516c842cf1e9d614b39745f516286.poster.avif?t=1753728516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/6e6516c842cf1e9d614b39745f516286.webm?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/6e6516c842cf1e9d614b39745f516286.mp4?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents of the Demo Version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 playable hero</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique parasites and props</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 major areas (featuring 40 regular enemies, 6 elites, and 3 bosses)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/24dfdaf8b26a39c015266aac5204f91a.poster.avif?t=1753728516\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/24dfdaf8b26a39c015266aac5204f91a.webm?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361600/extras/24dfdaf8b26a39c015266aac5204f91a.mp4?t=1753728516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More interesting content and features are still under development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Discord\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F8n95AWgpX</p>",
